.TH L10N-LINT 1 "February 2026" "l10n-lint 1.3.6" "User Commands"
.SH NÉV
l10n-lint \- linter for localization files
.SH ÁTTEKINTÉS
.B l10n-lint
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIPATH\fR...
.SH LEÍRÁS
.B l10n-lint
checks gettext .po and Qt .ts localization files for common issues:
missing translations, fuzzy entries, placeholder mismatches, and length problems.
.SH BEÁLLÍTÁSOK
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show version number and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-recursive
Do not search subdirectories.
.TP
.BR \-\-check " " \fICHECK\fR
Enable specific check (can be repeated).
Available: missing, fuzzy, placeholders, length-ratio, too-long
.TP
.BR \-\-skip " " \fICHECK\fR
Skip specific check (can be repeated).
.TP
.BR \-\-format " " \fIFORMAT\fR
Output format: text (default), json, github
.TP
.BR \-\-length\-ratio " " \fIN\fR
Maximum translation/source length ratio (default: 3.0)
.TP
.BR \-\-max\-length " " \fIN\fR
Maximum translation length in characters (default: 500)
.SH KILÉPÉSI ÁLLAPOT
.TP
.B 0
No issues found.
.TP
.B 1
Issues found or error occurred.
.SH PÉLDÁK
.TP
Check all .po files in current directory:
.B l10n-lint .
.TP
Check specific file with JSON output:
.B l10n-lint \-\-format json messages.po
.TP
Skip fuzzy check:
.B l10n-lint \-\-skip fuzzy locale/
.SH SZERZŐ
Daniel Nylander <daniel@danielnylander.se>
.SH LÁSD MÉG
.BR msgfmt (1),
.BR msginit (1),
.BR tp-lint (1),
.BR po-translate (1)
.SH HIBÁK
Report bugs at: https://github.com/yeager/l10n-lint/issues
